*> vybe-test: cobol/numeric_picture_editing/pic_x_inside_group
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_numeric_picture_editing.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 GRP.
   05 FNAME PIC X(5) VALUE "ALICE".
   05 LNAME PIC X(5) VALUE "JONES".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY FNAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FNAME DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ALICE"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ALICE] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY LNAME.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING LNAME DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "JONES"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [JONES] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

